# 行尾统一为 LF：仓库里的 .cjs/.ts/.md 曾经是 CRLF 与 LF 混杂
# （164 CRLF + 14 LF），Windows 与 macOS 两台机器协同会出现整文件 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源：不做行尾转换（也让 diff 正确识别为 binary）
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.asar binary
*.pak binary
*.bin binary
*.cnode binary

# 生成的评测报告与临时产物不纳入 diff 噪音
docs/eval-reports/** linguist-generated=true
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated=true
